<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 2. OUR STORY                                     -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="about-story">
  <div class="about-container story-grid">
    <div class="story-text reveal-left">
      <div class="eyebrow gold">OUR STORY</div>
      <h2>Born from a Passion<br>for <span class="gold">Precision</span></h2>
      <p>TYMORA was born from an uncompromising belief — that a timepiece is not merely a device that tells the hour, but a statement of character, refinement, and identity.</p>
      <p>We founded TYMORA to bridge the gap between the world's most exceptional watchmakers and those who truly appreciate them. Every watch in our collection is selected with rigorous standards — for movement quality, heritage, design, and above all, enduring worth.</p>
      <p>Our promise is simple: every piece that carries the TYMORA name is authentic, exceptional, and worthy of your wrist.</p>
      <div class="story-line"></div>
      <div class="signature">
        <div class="sig-name">TYMORA</div>
        <div class="sig-title">HOUSE OF LUXURY HOROLOGY</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-image reveal-right">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622434641406-a158123450f9?w=800&q=80" alt="Craftsmanship" loading="lazy">
      <div class="story-img-badge">
        <span class="badge-num">100%</span>
        <span class="badge-label">Authentic</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 3. MISSION CARDS                                 -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="about-mission">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="section-header text-center reveal-up">
      <div class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</div>
      <h2>What Drives <span class="gold">Everything We Do</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-card reveal-up">
        <div class="mission-icon"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></div>
        <h3>Quality First</h3>
        <p>Every timepiece is hand-selected and verified for authenticity, movement integrity, and finishing quality before it ever reaches your hands.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card reveal-up" style="animation-delay:0.15s">
        <div class="mission-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
        <h3>Authenticity Guaranteed</h3>
        <p>We source exclusively from authorised dealers and certified pre-owned markets. Every piece comes with full documentation and provenance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card reveal-up" style="animation-delay:0.3s">
        <div class="mission-icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
        <h3>Exceptional Experience</h3>
        <p>From the moment you browse to the moment your timepiece arrives, we craft an experience as refined as the watch itself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 4. WHY CHOOSE TYMORA                             -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
