      <div class="why-item reveal-up"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i><h4>Premium Collections</h4><p>The rarest and most celebrated references, curated exclusively for discerning tastes.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item reveal-up"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i><h4>Secure Payments</h4><p>SSL-protected checkout with industry-leading payment security on every transaction.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item reveal-up"><i class="fas fa-shipping-fast"></i><h4>Fast Delivery</h4><p>Pan India delivery with insured, secure packaging crafted for precious cargo.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item reveal-up"><i class="fas fa-undo"></i><h4>Easy Returns</h4><p>30-day hassle-free return policy. If it isn't perfect, we make it right.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item reveal-up"><i class="fas fa-headset"></i><h4>Dedicated Support</h4><p>Our expert concierge team is available to assist with every query and concern.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item reveal-up"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><h4>Quality Assurance</h4><p>Multi-point inspection on every piece. Zero compromises, zero exceptions.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

